          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pangali mu Isalaeli jutacilya mawuta kapena miasi kulikose kuti mkatame. Lyeleli ni lilamusi lyakwenela kulisunga Aisalaeli wosope kulikose kutakatame.",
          "type": "text",
